#: app/auction_guide.py:13
msgid ""
"Pick-up in Frankfurt (Nordend) on weekday evenings. Shipping within "
"Germany possible, buyer pays about 35 euros."
msgstr ""

#: app/auction_guide.py:14
msgid "Hand-over at the club meeting in March or by courier at the buyer's cost."
