#: app/startup_guide.py:33 app/templates/modules/tool_report_findings.html:41
msgid "Problem"
msgstr ""

#: app/startup_guide.py:34
msgid ""
"Whose problem do you solve and how painful is it today? Use a concrete "
"situation or number."
msgstr ""

#: app/startup_guide.py:36
msgid ""
"Freelancers spend about five hours a month sorting receipts and often "
"lose deductible costs."
msgstr ""

#: app/startup_guide.py:37
msgid ""
"Small shops pay for peak energy prices because they cannot store power "
"from their own roofs."
msgstr ""

